            <article class="card-link">
                <h3 class="card-link-title">Where is my inspection data stored?</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">On EU servers in Germany, run by Hetzner. The platform is built to be GDPR-aligned, so residency, security and retention are handled to a high baseline wherever your crews work.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <h3 class="card-link-title">Does it meet Australian expectations?</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">Quickler is rooted in UK and EU practice and is GDPR-aligned, broadly recognised as a strong standard. We do not give legal advice, so confirm your specific duties with your adviser, but the underlying principles line up well.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <h3 class="card-link-title">Why beat paper for an audit?</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">Every answer, photo and voice note becomes a timestamped, searchable record on a dashboard with red, amber and green status. You can prove who recorded what and when, and export a PDF when a document is needed.</p>
